sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant FE as Next.js API Proxy
    participant API as Go Core
    participant R as Redis Streams
    participant W as Python Worker
    participant M as MinIO
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    B->>FE: POST /api/upload (multipart + JWT)
    FE->>API: POST /upload
    API->>M: PutObject photos/raw/{uuid}.{ext}
    API->>DB: INSERT photos(status=processing,user_id,...)
    API->>R: XADD image_processing_queue(photo_id,minio_path)
    API-->>B: 201 queued

    W->>R: XREADGROUP image_processing_queue
    W->>M: GET photos/raw/{...}
    W->>W: decode/EXIF/thumbnail/proxy
    W->>M: PUT photos/proxy/{...}.webp
    W->>M: PUT photos/thumb/{...}.webp
    W->>API: PUT /internal/photos/:id/status + exif_data
    API->>DB: UPDATE photos.status + UPSERT exif_data
    W->>R: XACK image_processing_queue

    B->>FE: POST /api/photos/:id/analyze
    FE->>API: POST /api/photos/:id/analyze
    API->>R: XADD ai_analysis_queue(provider,api_key,model,...)
    W->>R: XREADGROUP ai_analysis_queue
    W->>M: GET photos/proxy/{...}.webp
    W->>API: PUT /internal/photos/:id/analysis
    API->>DB: UPDATE photos.ai_analysis
    W->>R: XACK ai_analysis_queue

    B->>FE: POST /api/photos/:id/export
    FE->>API: POST /api/photos/:id/export
    API->>DB: INSERT export_jobs(status=pending)
    API->>R: XADD export_queue(job_id,photo_id,export_options)
    W->>R: XREADGROUP export_queue
    W->>M: GET photos/raw/{...}
    W->>M: PUT photos/exports/{...}
    W->>API: PUT /internal/exports/:job_id/status(completed,output_path)
    API->>DB: UPDATE export_jobs
    W->>R: XACK export_queue
